    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-en-390.009",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 9,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 172,
      "width": 337,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 43,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 48,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "Your words aren’t",
        "always",
        "your beliefs."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-2b6229724706",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-en-390.010",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 10,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 350,
      "width": 334,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 18,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 26.099999999999998,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "A careful archive needs more than a",
        "user label."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-4ce393ffb42a",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-en-390.011",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 11,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 424,
      "width": null,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 11,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 15.95,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#707975",
      "lines": [
        "PAIA · Editorial draft for publication review"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-b6b352df7872",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-en-390.012",
      "kind": "photograph",
      "paint_order": 12,
      "asset": "light",
      "x": 24,
      "y": 480,
      "width": 342,
      "height": 235,
      "rotation": -0.6,
      "crop_xywh": [
        0.0,
        484.65,
        1500.0,
        1030.7
      ],
      "position": [
        0.5,
        0.5
      ],
      "arch": false
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-en-390.013",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 13,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 774,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 29,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "Imagine sending an AI a job description",
        "and asking whether the role is a good fit.",
        "The words are in your message. The",
        "employer’s requirements are not",
        "suddenly your ambitions. A system that",
        "preserves the message has recorded a",
        "fact. A system that turns every line into",
        "your preference has made a different,",
        "unsupported move."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-22651461e9fe",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-en-390.014",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 14,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1066,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 29,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "The same problem appears with",
        "quotations, counterarguments, role-play,",
        "translation and drafts written for",
        "someone else. Even a sentence you",
        "wrote entirely yourself may be a",
        "hypothesis, not a conclusion. Its meaning",
        "depends on the question you were",
        "exploring."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-8b6e4e77bbbe",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-en-390.015",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 15,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1329,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 29,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "This is why PAIA treats an original",
        "expression and an interpretation of that",
        "expression as different things. The",
        "source can tell you what was sent. A",
        "topic can help bring related material",
        "together. An AI-organized presentation",
        "may make it easier to read. None of these",
        "should silently become a new personal",
        "truth."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-89c196ee50ff",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-en-390.016",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 16,
      "x1": 24,
      "y1": 1641,
      "x2": 104,
      "y2": 1641,
      "stroke": "#a0a99e",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-en-390.017",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 17,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1683,
      "width": 337,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 35,
      "font_style": "italic",
      "line_height": 43,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "The useful amount may",
        "be",
        "three sentences, not three",
        "years."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-82a5cd584e11",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-en-390.018",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 18,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1929,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 29,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "Good organization leaves room for",
        "uncertainty. It should allow you to inspect",
        "evidence, correct wording and exclude",
        "something without having to fight a",
        "confident story about yourself. A note",
        "that says “I am considering this” should",
        "not become “I have decided this.”"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-8ebc58107c11",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-en-390.019",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 19,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 2163,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 29,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "This distinction becomes especially",
        "important when material is reused.",
        "Context for a new task needs relevance,",
        "but it also needs the right role for each",
        "passage. A quotation remains a",
        "quotation. An earlier plan can be",
        "identified as an earlier plan. A current",
        "preference can be selected because you",
        "have deliberately confirmed it."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-1e3e94664980",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-en-390.020",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 20,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 2455,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 29,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "The aim is not to make your archive timid.",
        "It is to make it trustworthy enough to",
        "work with: useful structure, visible origins",
        "and the last word left with you."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-6e66fd2b5e33",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-en-390.021",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 21,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 2628,
      "width": 335,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 11,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 15.95,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#707975",
      "lines": [
        "A product perspective, not a claim of released capability."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-02dda9d1f87c",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-en-390.022",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 22,
      "x1": 24,
      "y1": 2729,
      "x2": 366,
